      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boulder_Junction%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Boulder Junction was formerly home to the Northern Wisconsin National Canoe Base, a national base of the Boy Scouts of America.",
